UncleMario: Good morning, [i]'nak[/i]. [input]I see you've finished moving in, ah?
UncleMario: Your [i]Lola[/i] would be proud seeing you behind that counter.
UncleMario: Need a quick rundown of the store, or are you ready to run this place on your own? (Use mouse wheel or arrow keys to choose)
- Help me out, Uncle
	UncleMario: [i][wave]Mabuti.[/wave][/i] Let's keep it quick!
- Nah, I'm good!
	UncleMario: [i]Naku, anak[/i]. [shake]You're not![/shake]
	UncleMario: Let's start from the beginning.
UncleMario: First... pricing! Press [i]V[/i] to toggle your pricing lens, look at any product on the shelf, and scroll to adjust its price steps.
UncleMario: Go ahead and try adjusting the price of an [color=#0f6e2f]Anoba[/color] on the shelf to your left!
[signal arg="wait_for_price_change"]
UncleMario: Nice! 
UncleMario: You can also press [i]L[/i] anytime to open your full Store Price Ledger.
UncleMario: Remember, lower prices earn generous tips from customers, while higher prices might get a few complaints — so pick your choice, ah!
UncleMario: Speaking of [color=#0f6e2f]Anoba[/color], I'm starving! Grab one from the shelf and hand it to me!
[signal arg="wait_for_sale"]
UncleMario: [wave]Crunch crunch...[/wave] Ahh! That hits the spot.
UncleMario: Over to your right is the Refrigerator for cold drinks and frozen goods. Click the handle to open it!
[signal arg="wait_for_fridge"]
UncleMario: See that coldness bar? Don't leave the door open too long, or the cold escapes and chilled goods lose value until it cools back down!
UncleMario: Go ahead and close the fridge door now!
[signal arg="wait_for_fridge_close"]
UncleMario: Nice! Keeping that door shut saves your profits.
UncleMario: Last thing! Whenever you run low on stock — or want to upgrade your store with new tiers, fridge parts, a trash can, or even a lucky cat — use the Nokia phone behind you.
UncleMario: Type [i]MARIO[/i] on the keypad and press the top-right button — or just press the asterisk (*) shortcut.
UncleMario: Go on, give it a test call right now!
[signal arg="wait_for_tutorial_call"]
UncleMario: Haha!
UncleMario: I'm standing right here in front of you, [i]'nak[/i]!
UncleMario: At least you know it works! Oh — and right beside the phone is the Debt Notebook for any customers asking for [color=#0f6e2f]utang[/color].
jump SuccessOutro

label Satisfy
label SuccessOutro
UncleMario: That's everything you need to know!
UncleMario: I'm going to grab my coffee and pandesal now.
jump Outro

label SkipOutro
UncleMario: Right, you've always been a quick one.
UncleMario: If you're that confident, I'll leave you to it. Just don't burn the place down!
jump Outro

label Outro
UncleMario: Good luck today, [i]anak[/i]. See you around!
[signal arg="refuse_service"]
